# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:2
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_ed66347d:

    # "The barracks were built into the north-eastern wall of the fort."
    "兵舎は、砦の北東側の壁に組み込まれて建てられていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:3
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_2c7f6a1f:

    # "Cold, moist air welcomed us into what seemed to be our living quarters from now on."
    "冷たく湿った空気が、これから私たちの住処となる場所へと、私たちを迎えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:4
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_3722f164:

    # "Recruits were trying on their new armor. Some just sat on their bunks, concerned."
    "新入りたちは新しい鎧を試着していた。中にはただ寝台に座り、心配そうにしている者もいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:5
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_361bb228:

    # "As I was circling a particularly big guy adjusting straps on his armor, I found myself standing beside two empty bunks."
    "特に大きな鎧の紐を直している巨漢を避けて通ろうとすると、俺は二つの空いた寝台の横に立っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:6
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_adffd1b9:

    # "I turned to face Markus."
    "私はマーカスの方を向いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:9
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_33d0a905:

    # MC "I guess these are as good as any."
    MC "まあこれでいいか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:10
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_8c386ccb:

    # MARKUS "You seriously think we get to pick?"
    MARKUS "選べると思ってんの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:11
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_875938d3:

    # MC "Well, I don't see any of them ordering us around."
    MC "まあ、彼らが命令してくる様子は見えないな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:12
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_8095938a:

    # "With that, I waved towards a couple of guards at the far end of the room."
    "そう言って、部屋の奥にいる二人の警備員に向かって手を振った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:13
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_53f458a8:

    # "Markus nodded."
    "マルクスは頷いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:14
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "しょうがない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:16
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_834c6edf:

    # "Wooden trunks Joakim mentioned were set beside each bed."
    "ヨアキムが言っていた木製のトランクが、それぞれのベッドの横に置かれていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:17
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_f6bc5929:

    # "I opened mine and was greeted by predatory glint of a halfway-sheathed sword."
    "私の方を開けると、鞘に半分収まった剣の不気味な輝きが現れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:18
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_10c49309:

    # "Beneath it was a rather heavy set of leather armor."
    "その下には、ずっしりと重い革鎧があった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:29
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_39e0278a:

    # "A short while later..."
    "少し後…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:38
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_c757ea9d:

    # "Markus stretched about and flexed his arms as I was fitting the sheath onto my belt."
    "マルカスは伸びをして、腕を曲げたりしてた。俺が帯に鞘を付けている間に。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:39
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_790ea3fc:

    # MARKUS "It's very tight in my... private area."
    MARKUS "私の…秘所が、とてもきついです。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:40
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_d01f552c:

    # MC "Mine's okay."
    MC "私のは大丈夫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:41
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_92f0967b:

    # MARKUS "Exactly."
    MARKUS "その通り。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:42
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_5a4a2f7e:

    # MC "Go to h~"
    MC "Hめに行け~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:43
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_82d486b0:

    # GUARD "Recruits!"
    GUARD "新兵達!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:44
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_454e72d0:

    # "One of the guards shouted in a commanding tone, ceasing all activity in the barracks."
    "衛兵の一人が命令口調で叫び、兵舎内の全ての動きを差し止めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:45
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_5cb164df:

    # GUARD "Get strapped and head out into the yard now! This is not a fashion contest!"
    GUARD "しっかりと装備して庭へと繰り出せ!  
これはファッションコンテストじゃないんだぞ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:47
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_eda86dd2:

    # "I adjusted my sheath belt and nodded to Markus."
    "鞘ベルトを調整し、マーカスにうなずいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:48
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_fc84574c:

    # MARKUS "Mission complete, I guess."
    MARKUS "任務完了、かな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:50
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_bcc804a7:

    # "We headed out to the yard along with other recruits."
    "他の新兵と一緒に庭へと向かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:51
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_32fab128:

    # "Being no more but a crowd of armed civilians, we now looked like we belonged to a single military unit, for what its worth."
    "元はと言えば武装した市民に過ぎなかったが、今や我々は一応、単一の部隊に属しているように見えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:62
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_45d8f227:

    # "Out on the yard the recruits gathered, talking and examining each other."
    "中庭で新兵たちが集まり、互いに話し、観察し合っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:63
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_1e31f202:

    # "I noticed that redhead from before walking past us."
    "さっきの赤髪が横を通り過ぎるのが目に入った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:65
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_cc6c0c9a:

    # KIARA @ happy "Looking good, boys!"
    KIARA @ happy "いい感じだ、みんな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:66
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c91ac63e:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Yeah, you too, young lady!"
    MARKUS @ smile "ああ、お前もな、お嬢ちゃん!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:67
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_33bad0b1:

    # "As she passed us, I stole another glance at that leather-clad beauty and asked Markus:"
    "彼女が通り過ぎると、私は革服の美女をもう一度こっそりと目をやり、マーカスに尋ねた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:69
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_30f15ad3:

    # MC "How's that private area of yours doing now, huh?"
    MC "あの場所、今どうなってるの？ねぇ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:70
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_111c74c8:

    # MARKUS "You have no idea..."
    MARKUS "お前にはわからない…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:77
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5dfda96d:

    # "Suddenly, the doors flung open and a short man with a grey beard stormed through them."
    "突然、扉が押し開けられ、灰色の髭を生やした小柄な男が怒鳴り込んできた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:78
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8e289369:

    # "Stocky, he carried with him heavy armour covered in scratches and dirt that clanked with every movement."
    "ずんぐりとした体躯に、傷と泥にまみれた重い鎧をまとっており、動くたびにガチャガチャと音を立てた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:79
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0dc6b792:

    # "More impressive was the monumental axe slung over his back that looked sharp enough to cut glass and the edges of which were traced with enchanted blue lines, eerily incandescent."
    "さらに印象的だったのは、彼の背中に担がれた巨大な斧で、ガラスをも切り裂きそうな鋭さを湛え、その刃には神秘的な青い線が浮かび上がり、不気味な輝きを放っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:80
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_31b98a0f:

    # "He vaulted forward onto the wooden podium Joakim lectured us from and landed with surprising grace, wood creaking under his heavy boots."
    "彼はヨアキムが講義する木製の演壇に跳び乗り、重いブーツで木材を軋ませながら、驚くほどの優雅さで着地した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:81
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_24a5c132:

    # "He glowered down at us as he scanned the crowd from right to left."
    "彼は右から左へと群衆を見渡しながら、我々を睨み下ろしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:82
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_afebb2e4:

    # "We fell into an ominous silence as we waited for what he would say."
    "不気味な沈黙に陥った。俺たちは、彼が次に何を言い出すのかを待っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:83
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b9d9c4d5:

    # "Finally, with a heavy sigh, he began:"
    "ついに、彼は重ためるため息をつくと、語り始めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:85
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_1bf2dc79:

    # DUPREY "I am Captain Duprey, leader of the Second Scouts Division."
    DUPREY "私はデュプレー隊長、第2斥候隊の責任者です。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:86
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0156ee5b:

    # DUPREY "It is a great honour to be called upon to serve with the Scouts. I trust that you understand what has been bestowed upon you."
    DUPREY "本隊への配属は、大変な光栄です。授けられた意味を、お見込みの通りご理解ください。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:87
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_48443525:

    # DUPREY "Many of you are pissing yourselves right now and probably have been since you found out you were joining these corps."
    DUPREY "お前らの大半は今、漏らすほどびびってるんだろうが、おそらく隊への配属が決まった時からそうなんだろうが。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:88
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6eecb82f:

    # DUPREY "You have probably spent these last few years learning all the proper terms, the fancy tactics and no doubt some very pretty footwork as a part of the basic combat training you all had received."
    DUPREY "おそらく君たちはここ数年、基本戦闘訓練として正しい用語や凝った戦術、そして間違いなく非常に優れたフットワークを学んできたことだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:89
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6e19fe3e:

    # DUPREY "We are going to work you {i}hard{/i} to forget all that!"
    DUPREY "私たちがあなたを{i}きつく{/i}働かせて、全部忘れさせるからね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:91
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_077f216b:

    # CROWD "{i}*Confused murmurs*{/i}"
    CROWD "{i}*混乱した呟き*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:92
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_03077b09:

    # DUPREY "I am not interested in you showing me your majestic flying three-sixty spinning limp dicked thrust!"
    DUPREY "お前のだらしのないチンコの雄大な空中360度回転突きを見せびらかすのには興味ないんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:93
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_ecac7050:

    # DUPREY "You will learn practical things here. You will learn how to be dirty in the fight to level the field against {i}the Demorai{/i}."
    DUPREY "ここでは実用的なことを学ぶ。{i}デモライ{/i}に対抗して互角に戦うため、戦いで卑怯になる方法を学ぶのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:94
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_e9df6359:

    # DUPREY "You will learn how to kill, without mercy and without hesitation."
    DUPREY "あなたは、容赦なく、躊躇いなく、殺し方を学ぶでしょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:95
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_45026bd0:

    # DUPREY "You will learn {i}to win.{/i}"
    DUPREY "君は{i}勝つことを学ぶ{/i}だろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:96
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_3d3a4c07:

    # "One of the men stepped forward nervously to raise his hand."
    "男の一人が、おずおずと前に進み出て手を挙げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:98
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_d3da28fb:

    # RECRUIT "A-Aren’t we supposed to fight honourably though?"
    RECRUIT "あ、あの…立派に戦うんじゃないんですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:99
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_75f8880f:

    # DUPREY "... Come here."
    DUPREY "…　こっちにおいで"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:100
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_995efa62:

    # "The man looked around, unsure of what to do."
    "男はどうすればいいかわからず、あたりを見回した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:102
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_f3e4c30d:

    # DUPREY "I SAID COME HERE!"
    DUPREY "来いよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:103
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9e1355c7:

    # "Some of the guards moved to shove the man out of the line, where he climbed hesitantly onto the stage with the Captain."
    "数人の衛兵が男を列から押しやり、彼は躊躇いながらキャプテンと共にステージへと乗り込んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:107
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_ffbf2113:

    # "Y-Yes, sir?"
    "は、はい…ご主人様？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:108
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8ac93488:

    # "Taking a small sword, the Captain threw it to the man’s feet."
    "小さな剣を取ると、隊長は男の足元に投げつけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:109
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_d682f5d8:

    # DUPREY "Strike me down."
    DUPREY "我を討て。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:110
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_15291902:

    # "The crowd was silent, the man looked at him bewildered."
    "群衆は静まり返っていた、男は当惑した様子で彼を見つめた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:112
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_967048d4:

    # RECRUIT "W-What?"
    RECRUIT "え、何？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0fca85b6:

    # DUPREY "Pick that sword up and strike me down, boy! That is an order."
    DUPREY "その剣を拾い、俺を斬れ、小僧! 命令だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:114
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_3ce74784:

    # RECRUIT "... But I—"
    RECRUIT "だが私—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_30606e01:

    # DUPREY "YOU FUCKING MAGGOT!"
    DUPREY "キサマこの虫けら!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:117
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_635fa0f5:

    # DUPREY "DO AS YOU’RE TOLD OR I’LL FLAY YOU MYSELF AND HANG YOUR BODY FROM THE WALLS AS A WARNING TO ANYONE ELSE THAT CAN’T FOLLOW SIMPLE FUCKING ORDERS."
    DUPREY "言うことを聞かなければ、俺がお前の皮を剥ぎ取って城壁に晒し者にしてやる。ふざけた命令一つ聞けない奴らへの見せしめだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:118
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_84e18a54:

    # "Terrified, the man scurried to pick up the sword, trembling as he pointed it towards the Captain."
    "恐れ慄いた男は、剣を拾い上げようと急いで、震えながら隊長へ向けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:119
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c22cf657:

    # DUPREY "... Now, STRIKE ME!"
    DUPREY "…今こそ、打て!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:129
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5b9f4532:

    # "The man cried out as he lunged forward to attack the Captain."
    "と、男は叫んで艦長に襲いかかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:130
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_2ce3e37e:

    # "Side stepping the blade, the Captain locked in the man’s arms and the two wrestled vehemently over the sword."
    "刀をかわすと、艦長はその男の腕に組み付き、二人は激しく剣の主導権を争い合った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:140
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b7d5ce0d:

    # "So fast it was almost a blur, the Captain shoved his head forward, violently headbutting the unsuspecting man."
    "間髪入れず、艦長は頭を突き出し、不意を突かれた男の顔面に激しく頭突きを喰らわせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:141
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b0a3df0b:

    # "His nose ruptured open; blood streamed down his face so forcefully that when he screamed it spattered over Duprey."
    "彼の鼻が破裂し、あまりに勢いよく顔を流れ落ちる血が、彼が叫んだ時にデュプレイに跳ねかかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:142
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9cb326ef:

    # RECRUIT "You... You broke my nose!"
    RECRUIT "お前…お前が私の鼻を折った!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:143
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5b4bc1f3:

    # DUPREY "MEDIC! Get this man to the ward."
    DUPREY "衛生兵!この男を病棟に運べ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:145
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6cac3d25:

    # "As a small team of people hurried over to drag the now delirious man through some black steel gates, the Captain casually continued his speech."
    "小さな一団が今は妄言を吐く男を黒鉄の門へと急ぎ引きずっていく中、船長は何食わぬ顔で演説を続けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:147
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_07f99cb7:

    # DUPREY "Anymore {i}questions{/i} about the practicality of my methods?"
    DUPREY "私の方法の{i}実用性{/i}について、他に疑問は？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:149
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_826e674b:

    # CROWD "..."
    CROWD "……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:150
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_26caf7d6:

    # "I turned my head to look at Markus and found him glancing back, eyes wide open."
    "振り返ってマーカスを見ると、彼もまた目を合わせてきて、目を見開いていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:151
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9a989d7d:

    # DUPREY "I CAN’T HEAR YOU, YOU FUCKING WORMS!"
    DUPREY "聞こえねェ、この蛆虫共め!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:153
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_08e5605a:

    # CROWD "SIR, NO, SIR!"
    CROWD "はい、大尉!いいえ、大尉!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:154
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_38e3bacf:

    # DUPREY "Good... because the Demorai will not show you mercy!"
    DUPREY "よし…デモライはお前を容赦はしない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:155
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c6c53845:

    # DUPREY "They will not fight {i}with honour.{/i}"
    DUPREY "彼らは{i}正々堂々と{/i}戦わない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:156
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b7656e1a:

    # DUPREY "What they will do is rip you limb from limb and leave you with just enough life to watch as they slaughter your brothers and sisters!"
    DUPREY "奴らはお前の手足を引きちぎり、兄弟姉妹が惨殺されるのを見せつけるだけの命を残してくれるぞ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:157
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_826e674b_1:

    # CROWD "..."
    CROWD "……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:158
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_2dd78c1b:

    # DUPREY "I am not an easy man, I am not a {i}nice{/i} man, but if you listen to me, I might just be the man that teaches you how to stay the fuck alive."
    DUPREY "俺は甘くねえ、{i}優しい{/i}男でもねえが、俺の言うことを聞けば、どうやって死なずに生き延びるかを教えてやれる男にはなれるだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:159
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_7c88f9b8:

    # CROWD "SIR, YES, SIR!"
    CROWD "了解しました、長官!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:160
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_f353d7a9:

    # DUPREY "Your training begins now, maggots."
    DUPREY "訓練開始だ、蛆虫共。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:161
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_a243b483:

    # "Duprey leapt off the platform and headed towards an area of the fort the sound of swords clanking was coming from."
    "デュプレはプラットフォームから飛び降り、砦の中でも剣の打ち合う音がする方角へと向かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:163
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_bb84b5e5:

    # DUPREY "On me!"
    DUPREY "任せて!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:164
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_e1fbe915:

    # "The crowd of recruits followed the dwarf, shuffling their feet towards the training area."
    "新兵たちの一団は、小人に続いて、足を引きずりながら訓練場へと向かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:165
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_a207265b:

    # "I turned around, and couldn't see Markus."
    "振り返ると、マーカスの姿はなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:166
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8a0f909c:

    # MC "(*Sigh* Okay, let's get this over with.)"
    MC "(*ため息* よし、さっさと終わらせてしまおう。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:172
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3f6bcf4c:

    # "Entering the training area, I navigated my way through a crowd of recruits until I saw Markus beside me."
    "訓練場に入ると、新人たちの群れをかき分けながら進み、やがて傍らにマーカスの姿が見えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:175
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_56bb8c5f:

    # MC "Markus?"
    MC "マルクス？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:176
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9d535044:

    # MARKUS "Tried to find an escape route?"
    MARKUS "逃げ道を探そうとしたか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:177
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_cb29500d:

    # "A couple recruits glanced at us over their shoulders."
    "新兵が数人、振り返ってこちらを見た。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:178
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c92ce338:

    # MARKUS "Yeah, right... Let's enjoy the show now."
    MARKUS "ああ、そうだな…さあ、ショーを楽しもう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:179
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1e426a5d:

    # DUPREY "Recruits, stand at attention!"
    DUPREY "新兵、気をつけ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:185
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_2ea90ceb:

    # DUPREY "Let's see what we're working with here!"
    DUPREY "ここで何ができるかな？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:186
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e93c1e63:

    # "Duprey glared at us, evaluating the raw material he was about to begin his work on."
    "デュプレイは我々を睨みつけ、これから加工しようとする素材を見極めていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:187
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_31a8afcf:

    # DUPREY "For starters, give me twenty laps along these walls."
    DUPREY "まずは、この壁沿いに二十周走れ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:189
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7ba801cb:

    # "The next few hours were a flurry of footwork and drill manoeuvres."
    "その後数時間は、足さばきと演習の動きが怒涛のごとく続いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:190
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_01d01bfe:

    # "There was nothing performative about it, no crowds to admire the techniques, utterly practical evaluation of our physical abilities."
    "演技的なものは一切なく、技を賞賛する観衆もおらず、ごく実用的な身体能力の評価であった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:191
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7d87a1d8:

    # "Finally, exhausted and covered from head to toe in mud and bruises, the Captain called out for us to cease and form orderly ranks."
    "疲れ果て、泥と傷で全身が覆われた姿で、隊長は停止し整列するよう命じた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:196
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e25404d9:

    # DUPREY "Very good, all... Very good!"
    DUPREY "結構、全員… 結構です!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:201
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_60e2af20:

    # "As the Captain got off the podium, he wandered menacingly up and down the new, now exhausted recruits."
    "船長が演壇を降りると、新入りで、もはや疲れ果てた新兵たちの前を不気味に歩き回った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:202
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_d376b29a:

    # "He finally stopped in front of the girl I had eyed up earlier."
    "彼はついに、私がさきほど目をつけていた少女の前で立ち止まった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:205
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1c556712:

    # DUPREY "{i}You...{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}あなた…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:208
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_cc3e7297:

    # KIARA @ scared "... M-Me, sir?"
    KIARA @ scared "…わ、私でございますか旦那さん？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:209
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e2274450:

    # DUPREY "Yes, fucking you! Who else did you think I was talking to?"
    DUPREY "てめえだよ!他に誰がいるんだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:210
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_8510aacd:

    # KIARA @ scared "Yes, sir! Sorry, sir!"
    KIARA @ scared "はい、長官!すみません、長官!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:211
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_22b0f868:

    # "Her voice was soft, but clearly northern as it had the heavy twang of the highland regions."
    "その声は柔らかかったが、北部のものであることがはっきりと分かった。高地地方のきつい訛りを帯びていたからだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:212
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_36fc92e8:

    # "The Captain stared at her for a few moments, allowing the distinctive accent to roll off her tongue before asking."
    "艦長はしばらく彼女を見つめ、彼女の独特な訛りが舌の上で響くのを聞き届けてから尋ねた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:213
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a56e8d40:

    # DUPREY "... And where are you from?"
    DUPREY "... それで、あなたはどちらのご出身ですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:214
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_81aca2ab:

    # KIARA "Angmurus, sir!"
    KIARA "アングムルスさん!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:217
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af0a4203:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Angmurian, you say?"
    DUPREY @ laugh "アングムリアン、だって？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:218
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7affa54d:

    # "The Captain smirked."
    "キャプテンはニヤリと笑った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:220
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_428d8001:

    # DUPREY "Tell me, girl, is it true you all learn to master dual blades?"
    DUPREY "教えてくれ、娘よ、お前たちは皆、二刀流を習得するというのは本当か？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:221
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ff8dbf7d:

    # KIARA "I... It is mostly for traditions sake, sir."
    KIARA "私は…大半は伝統に従ってのことです、旦那様。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:222
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_d47b76c9:

    # DUPREY "I didn’t ask if it was fucking for tradition or not, I asked if it was true."
    DUPREY "伝統のためかどうかなんて聞いてねえ、本当かどうか聞いたんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:223
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af4591a0:

    # KIARA @ scared "Yes, sir!"
    KIARA @ scared "はい、了解しました!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:224
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_6db54c4e:

    # DUPREY "... So, you’re {i}not{/i} just here to suck cock and spread your legs for the men then?"
    DUPREY "…じゃあ、お前は{i}ただ{/i}男のために股を開いてコックをしゃぶるためだけに来たわけじゃないんだな？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:225
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_982630ce:

    # "There was some laughter from the recruits as the girl’s face flooded crimson."
    "研修生たちから、少女の顔が真っ赤に染まるのを見て笑い声が漏れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:226
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_668423cc:

    # KIARA "... No, sir."
    KIARA "… いいえが、旦那。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:227
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_d00fc9ce:

    # DUPREY "Well, then..."
    DUPREY "それでは…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:229
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ff68c617:

    # "The Captain grabbed two wooden blades and threw them at her feet."
    "キャプテンは二振りの木刀を掴むと、彼女の足元に投げつけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:230
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_48ff44a2:

    # DUPREY "{i}Prove it.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}証明してみせろ。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:231
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c4a4d598:

    # "The girl paused and waited for a moment as the Captain took out a wooden staff and stepped up onto the podium."
    "少女は一瞬息をつくと、艦長が木の杖を取り出し壇上へと歩み出したのを待った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:232
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_edc25de0:

    # DUPREY "... Well, pick them up!"
    DUPREY "…さあ、拾いな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:234
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9def15c8:

    # "The girl did as she was told."
    "少女は言われた通りにした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:235
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_efe2ae5e:

    # DUPREY "Now get your fat ass up here, girl. I don’t have all day!"
    DUPREY "でぶっちょのケツを上げて来い、娘。一日中待てるわけじゃねえ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:236
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_877a9d86:

    # "There were some laughs again from a couple of the recruits."
    "また数人の新兵から笑い声が上がった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:237
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_62461244:

    # DUPREY @ angry "DID I SAY YOU COULD FUCKING LAUGH?"
    DUPREY @ angry "笑ってんじゃねえよ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:238
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a07d1a6f:

    # DUPREY "... Are you ready?"
    DUPREY "……準備はいいか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:239
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_2f65ab47:

    # "The girl raised her blades hesitantly."
    "少女は躊躇いながら刃を構えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:240
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_96b19e41:

    # DUPREY "... BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "…さあ、スタート!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:246
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_725c57b7:

    # "We watched as the Captain lunged forward aggressively with the spear."
    "キャプテンが槍を構え、猛然と前に飛び出した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:248
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_143afabf:

    # "Much to everyone’s surprise, the girl did far better than expected."
    "誰もが驚いたことに、その少女は予想以上に良い結果を残した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:249
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1960f074:

    # "She deflected each blow parried her way and at one point even managed to kick the Captain back with her foot."
    "彼女は放たれる一撃一撃を撥ね退け、ついには足技で船長を蹴り飛ばすことさえあった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:252
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_62b6d361:

    # "The possibility that she might win hung tentatively in the air..."
    "彼女が勝つ可能性は、かすかに漂っていた…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:253
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af36f2ed:

    # "At the last moment, she managed to deflect another one of the Captain’s blows before swinging for him with what would have been a deathblow."
    "最後の瞬間、彼女は間一髪でキャプテンの攻撃をかわすと、今度は必殺の一撃を繰り出そうとした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:256
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_11ef0394:

    # "Before she could make it though, the Captain reached out his hand and, to everyone’s shock, a bolt of energy blasted the girl so brutally that the wood beneath her splintered as she hit the floor."
    "しかし、彼女が行動を起こすより早く、船長が手を伸ばすと、誰もが驚くことに、エネルギー弾が少女を襲い、あまりにも凄まじい衝撃で、床に叩きつけられた彼女の下の木材は粉々に砕けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:262
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_fcddbd23:

    # "As he brushed himself off, the girl looked up at the Captain, dazed and confused."
    "身繕いをしながら、少女はぼうっとした表情で船長を見上げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:263
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_91988c05:

    # KIARA @ scared "But... {i}how?{/i}"
    KIARA @ scared "しかし…{i}どうやって？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:264
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9fcae072:

    # KIARA @ scared "There’s no magic circle! How did you—"
    KIARA @ scared "魔法陣がない!どうやって——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:265
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_5bcc6cd8:

    # DUPREY "A good attempt, girl. You almost had me there."
    DUPREY "良い試みだ、娘よ。もう少しで騙されるところだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:266
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_f0504735:

    # "The Captain held out a hand, helping her back to her feet."
    "船長は手を差し伸べ、彼女を立ち上がらせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:267
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_b6aec33c:

    # "As he pulled her up, he leaned in to whisper something in her ear and his lips curled upwards into a small smile."
    "彼女を引き起こしながら、彼は耳元でささやくように唇を寄せ、口元が小さく緩んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:268
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_b8ee3afa:

    # KIARA @ scared "I don’t understand though... That kind of magic..."
    KIARA @ scared "でも……わからない
あの魔法……"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:269
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c1f1362c:

    # "The Captain smirked as he kicked some of the hay aside and revealed a magic circle concealed beneath."
    "船長はニヤリと笑い、わらを何束か蹴り除けると、その下に隠されていた魔法陣を露わにした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:270
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a51105ae:

    # "The crowd murmured, half in awe, half in surprise."
    "群衆はざわめき、半分は驚き、半分は畏敬の念を抱いていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:271
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_efda234b:

    # DUPREY "Like I said, girl, here, we don’t teach the fancy stuff."
    DUPREY "言っただろう、お嬢、ここで教えるのは高尚な技術じゃない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:272
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c762f908:

    # DUPREY "We teach you how to win. No matter what."
    DUPREY "何が何でも勝ち方を教える。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:273
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c59322b4:

    # "The crowd applauded and cheered as the girl smiled sheepishly."
    "観客は拍手と歓声を上げ、少女は照れくさそうに微笑んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:275
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05014119:

    # "When she got off the podium, she was welcomed back by the others who all patted her on the back for a fight well fought."
    "彼女が演壇から降りると、他の者たちが彼女を出迎え、よく戦ったと背中をポンポンと叩いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:277
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3e8845e2:

    # DUPREY "Alright everyone!"
    DUPREY "みんな、行くよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:278
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_53cb2fa8:

    # DUPREY "It's a start alright, but we still have a lot of work ahead of us!"
    DUPREY "始まったばかりだ、まだまだこれからだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:279
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05bea46f:

    # DUPREY "Now, go and take some rest."
    DUPREY "さあ、少し休みなさい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:281
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_df74a53c:

    # DUPREY "By the time the sun hits these training dummies, I expect you lot here again!"
    DUPREY "日がこの訓練用の人形に差す頃には、またお前らがここにいるはずだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:282
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "解散!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:300
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_0bd9b2e5:

    # DUPREY "It stands to reason, you maggots."
    DUPREY "当然だ、この蛆虫ども。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:301
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_c6b5eac0:

    # DUPREY "That to {i}kill{/i} the enemy, you must first strike him."
    DUPREY "敵を{i}倒す{/i}には、まず先に攻撃しなければならない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:302
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_75af9096:

    # DUPREY "You cannot hesitate with your blade, not even for a second."
    DUPREY "一瞬たりとも、刀を躊躇ってはならない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:303
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_56b25b16:

    # DUPREY "The Demorai will spare you no quarter."
    DUPREY "デモライは容赦はしない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:304
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_94c5eb63:

    # DUPREY "They know no fear."
    DUPREY "彼らには恐怖というものがわからない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:305
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_87825edf:

    # DUPREY "Hesitation does not exist in the minds of the enemy you will face."
    DUPREY "向き合うべき敵の精神に、躊躇いは存在しない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:306
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_2ae3da65:

    # DUPREY "They will not stop, they will keep coming until {i}you{/i} are dead."
    DUPREY "奴らは止まらない、{i}お前{/i}が死ぬまで襲い掛かってくる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:307
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_a1a19941:

    # DUPREY "...So {i}you{/i} will not stop, {i}you{/i} will know no hesitation either."
    DUPREY "…ならば{i}君{/i}は止まらない、{i}君{/i}は躊躇いも知らない"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:308
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_9ef65af9:

    # DUPREY "{i}You{/i} will make them kiss the blades you carry and grant them the death they so crave!"
    DUPREY "{i}貴方{/i}は彼らが携える刃に口づけさせ、切望する死を授けるのだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:309
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_931fd1a0:

    # "There was some cheering, whistles and claps from the recruits, but Captain Duprey remained stoically the same."
    "新兵たちから歓声、口笛、拍手が上がったが、デュプレイ船長は相変わらず無表情のままだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:310
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_3c541189:

    # DUPREY "When you strike at an enemy, if you're too slow they may dodge or block the strike."
    DUPREY "敵を攻撃する際、動きが遅すぎると相手が攻撃を回避したり防御したりすることがあります。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:311
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_935e6dba:

    # DUPREY "Get used to that feeling of metal clashing, you lose your blade out in the field, {i}you're finished.{/i}"
    DUPREY "金属がぶつかり合う感覚に慣れろよ、野戦で刀を失ったら、{i}それで終わりだ。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:312
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_bba80207:

    # DUPREY "Now grab someone to spar with."
    DUPREY "さあ、対戦相手を連れてきなさい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:313
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "……開幕!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:332
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7a71149d:

    # MARKUS "That was... good."
    MARKUS "それは…良かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:333
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b31d8f4f:

    # "Markus caught his breath and asked:"
    "マーカスは息を整えて尋ねた:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:334
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_34c43e8a:

    # MARKUS "Say, wanna go again?"
    MARKUS "ねぇ、もう一回どう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:337
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_732df93f:

    # "Markus looked around and figured we could go for another round."
    "マーカスは周りを見回して、もう一戦やれると考えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:338
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6c053eec:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again, shall we?"
    MARKUS "もう一度、
いきましょうか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:342
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_c9b50785:

    # MARKUS "Let's learn to handle these sticks of ours proper..."
    MARKUS "さて、俺たちのこの棒をちゃんと使いこなす方法を覚えようか…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:343
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f9bd7eb4:

    # MC "Sticks of ours? Wha~"
    MC "私たちの棒？なにぃ～"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:344
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_982720f4:

    # MARKUS "Defend yourself!"
    MARKUS "身を守れ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:349
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "まあいいか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:355
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_85180b52:

    # "We have spent the remainder of the day practicing more basic combat moves."
    "残りの時間、私たちはさらに基本的な戦闘動作の練習を続けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:357
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_950ca5f4:

    # "Exhausted, I made my way back towards the barracks."
    "疲れ切って、私は兵舎の方へと戻っていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:362
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b623e6ef:

    # "Entering the barracks, I was whistled over by a towering warrior I have seen a couple times before in the fort."
    "兵舎に入ると、これまでにも何度か砦で見かけた大柄な戦士が、口笛で私を呼び止めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:367
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_942cd646:

    # MC @ talk "Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "了解"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:368
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9493a3e8:

    # OFFICER @ talk "I am First Officer Borras, Captain Duprey's second in command."
    OFFICER @ talk "私は副長ボラス、デュプレー船長の副長です。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:369
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f902ebfc:

    # "I gulped as my body straightened and stiffened on its own."
    "思わず息を呑み、体が自然と伸びて硬直した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:370
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b1f42af4:

    # MC @ talk "S-sir?"
    MC @ talk "し、しゅじん？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:371
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3936d95e:

    # BORRAS @ talk "You're on cleaning duty tonight."
    BORRAS @ talk "今夜の掃除当番は君だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:373
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_8629b4ea:

    # MC @ talk "(Arrgh! Come on now!)"
    MC @ talk "(くっ、 こらっ!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:375
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9a2d9435:

    # MC @ talk "...Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "…はい、了解しました。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:378
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f4f3ec57:

    # "I spent the next hour or so mopping, polishing and cleaning the barracks from top to bottom."
    "それから一時間ほど、私は兵舎を上から下までモップで拭き、磨き、掃除した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:380
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_00514271:

    # "Finally, I found myself finished."
    "ついに、俺は自分が終えたことに気づいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:381
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4f1e169:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*はあ*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:382
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_278d91ab:

    # MC "(All that's left to do is clean the wash area.)"
    MC "残るは洗い場の掃除だけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:383
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_57878b2a:

    # "As I headed in, I heard what sounded like... splashing?"
    "中へと向かうと、水の音…ザブザブと聞こえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:384
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_68fec10d:

    # "At this hour?"
    "こんな時間に？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:385
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_554aa8aa:

    # "Realizing the splashing was coming from the woman's side, I pondered what to do..."
    "水音が女性の方から立っていることに気づき、どうすべきか考えた…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:390
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3b428651:

    # "It had felt like forever since I last got the chance to see a woman naked."
    "久しぶりに女性の裸を目にする機会が訪れたと思った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:391
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_bfd776ce:

    # "The temptation was too much to bear, and, letting my curiosity get the best of me, I peeked around the woman's side to take a look."
    "あまりの誘惑に耐えきれず、私は好奇心に負けて、女性の横からそっと覗き込んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:393
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_adf06afd:

    # "Kiara was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "キアラは裸でしゃがみ込んで、濡れたフランネルとバケツで体を洗っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:394
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4806da6:

    # KIARA "So, are you just going to stand there and watch?"
    KIARA "だから、ただそこに立って見てるだけ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:395
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3d654567:

    # MC @ scared "K-Kiara!"
    MC @ scared "く、キアラ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:396
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2df5f315:

    # "Realizing I'd been caught, Kiara, grabbing a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "気付いたキアラは、タオルを手に取り、体を包むと、腕を組んだまま私の方へ歩み寄ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:397
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a50ae3ab:

    # MC @ scared "It... It isn't what it looked like?"
    MC @ scared "そ…それは見えた通りじゃない？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:399
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1ca6c786:

    # "That scout girl I've seen around was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "あの斥候の少女が裸でしゃがみ込んで、濡れたフランネルとバケツで体を洗っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:400
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_edca490d:

    # KIARA "Kiara. Pleasure meeting you."
    KIARA "キアラ。よろしくお願いします。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:404
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2bbabbd5:

    # MC @ scared "Wh-what..."
    MC @ scared "な、なに…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:405
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_04b16aef:

    # "As I realized I was caught, I shot words at her in an apologetic burst:"
    "気付いたとき、私は一気に謝罪の言葉を彼女に浴びせた："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:407
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_478fa33b:

    # "Kiara grabbed a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "キアラはタオルを手に取ると、体に巻きつけながら、腕を組んだまま私の方へと歩み寄ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:414
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_cfb43425:

    # KIARA @ angry "So you {i}weren't{/i} just spying on me then?"
    KIARA @ angry "じゃあ、あなたは私を{i}単に{/i}スパイしてただけじゃないのね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:415
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_77f8c828:

    # MC "N-No, I came here to clean the wash rooms, I swear it so!"
    MC "い、いや、私は洗面所の掃除に来たんです、本当ですから!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:416
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_d56beb53:

    # "Kiara's stern expression softened as she laughed."
    "キアラの厳しい表情が、笑うと同時に和らいだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:417
