    "マーカスはデュプレイの言葉を完璧に引用しながら、微笑んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:569
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_4baaa790:

    # MC "Okay, I'll kick your ass now, {i}captain{/i}."
    MC "よし、ぶっ飛ばしてやるぜ、{i}キャプテン{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:570
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_397f9c31:

