    MARKUS "やっぱり、結構よかったよね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:577
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_eb54f1a5:

    # MC "Yeah, beats swinging it against these training dummies!"
    MC "ああ、訓練用の人形に振り回すよりはマシだな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:585
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ba3a1381:

    # "For the remainder of the day, Duprey educated us on the nuances of using various special skills, tools and items in battle."
    "その日はそれから、デュプレが様々な特殊技能やツール、アイテムを戦闘で使用する際のニュアンスについて教えてくれた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:586
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d61d0b14:

    # "Exhausted, I didn't really get much of it: magic refraction scrolls, ensnarement crystals, Vulshan smoke bombs..."
    "疲れ果てて、ほとんど頭に入らなかった：魔法屈折の巻物、捕獲用結晶体、ボールシャン煙玉…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:587
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_3a645881:

    # "Come dusk, Duprey concluded with showing us some advanced combat moves, I guess to somehow inspire us to master the art of combat."
    "夕暮れ時、デュプリーは高度な戦闘技を披露してくれた。おそらく、何とかして我々に戦闘術を習得させようという意図だったのだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:592
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ca79f8f3:

    # DUPREY "...So this is how you do the Waltzing Bazark strike."
    DUPREY "…これがワルツィング・バザーク打ちの極意か。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:593
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7f316660:

    # "Duprey caught his breath after executing a rather spectacular combat move."
    "デュプレイは華麗な一撃を決めた後、息を整えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:594
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_55a1cf16:

    # "He scanned the crowd of recruits, totally exhausted from another training session, and I can promise I saw a hint of fatherly smile on his face."
    "彼はくたびれ果てた新兵たちの群れを見渡し、顔にほんの少し父親めいた微笑みを浮かべていた、と私は誓ってもいい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:595
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_56df01de:

    # DUPREY "Okay, you lot."
    DUPREY "お前ら。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:596
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_60e9fa7e:

    # DUPREY "Go and take some rest now."
    DUPREY "行って、少し休んでくれ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:602
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_c70200c9:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other in confusion:"
    "僕とマーカスは困惑して顔を見合わせた："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:603
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_b1a7928d:

    # MC "A Waltzing Bazark? I'm not even trying something like that."
    MC "ワルツを踊るバザーク？そんなことはやろうとも思わない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:604
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_99873a35:

    # MARKUS "You'd be collecting me from all over the yard if I did..."
    MARKUS "庭先中、私を拾い集めることになるだろうよ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:651
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a66cc92:

    # "As my eyes slowly peeled open, a dark, raven haired blob was stood, lurched over the side of my bed."
    "ゆっくりと目を開けると、黒髪の塊がベッドの縁にかがみ込むように立っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:655
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_87f8b481:

    # "{i}Was this some kind of a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}これも夢なのだろうか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:656
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_9ce974a4:

    # "She leaned in close to whisper."
    "彼女は身を乗り出して、囁くように言った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:657
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_32cf642b:

    # REGINA @ smile "I've bought you some things, dear."
    REGINA @ smile "あなたにいくつか買ってきてあげたよ、ねえ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:658
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_6f52509f:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}Just a little something between the two of us...{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "{i}二人だけの秘密…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:659
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caa43851:

    # MC @ surprised "How ... How did you even get in here?"
    MC @ surprised "どうやって...どうやってここに入ったの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:660
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_257c75a7:

    # REGINA @ talk "Don't worry about that now, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "今はそのこと心配しないで、あなた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:661
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_eb2e578c:

    # REGINA @ talk "I just wanted to see you."
    REGINA @ talk "ただ会いたかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:662
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_fb531ee6:

    # MC @ talk "But-"
    MC @ talk "だけど…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:663
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24a60a73:

    # "As her hand gently caressed my cheek, I began to feel myself drifting back to the darkness once again."
    "彼女の手が私の頬を優しく撫でると、再び闇へと吸い込まれていくのを感じた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:665
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4ff52e4f:

    # "{i}Perhaps, this really was a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}もしかすると、これは本当に夢だったのだろうか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:666
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_ccaef93c:

    # REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Sleep, dear.{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "Shhh… {i}お休み、愛しい人{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:667
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_898758b8:

    # REGINA "{i}I'll always be here for you...{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}私はいつもここにいるよ…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:668
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3b1abd21:

    # REGINA "{i}...no matter what.{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}…何があっても。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:692
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caba15b5:

    # "Springing upright in my bed, soaked in sweat, I looked around as people prepared themselves for another day of training."
    "汗にまみれてベッドから跳ね起きると、人々が訓練の日々に身を整えているのが見えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:696
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24f0136a:

    # MC @ scared "I ... I think so."
    MC @ scared "私…そう思います。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:697
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_328b83d2:

    # MARKUS "Bad dreams?"
    MARKUS "悪い夢？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:699
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_b260c7ad:

    # MC @ scared "...I'm not sure what it was."
    MC @ scared "…よくわからないなんだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:700
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5d45ce3:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Well, you look like you've seen a ghost!"
    MARKUS @ shock "まるで幽霊でも見たみたいだね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:701
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5193f8a:

    # "Somehow, a ghost felt more explainable than what I saw last night..."
    "幽霊の方がまだ説明がつく、昨夜見たものよりは…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:702
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_247c26f4:

    # MARKUS "Come, I'm sure a few whacks from a training sword will take your mind off whatever it was!"
    MARKUS "さあ、練習用の剣で何発か振るえば、どんな悩みも気晴らしになるはずだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:705
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_a8954217:

    # "As Markus headed out of the barracks towards the training yard, I shook my head, pushing the strange dream aside."
    "マーカスが兵舎を出て訓練場へ向かう間、私は首を振り、あの奇妙な夢を心の隅へ押しやった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:707
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_83da7088:

    # "Opening my chest to grab my uniform, I noticed immediately the strangely placed bottle of red wine that wasn't there before..."
    "衣類箱を開けて制服を取りに手を伸ばすと、以前はなかったはずの、なぜか置かれた赤ワインの瓶がすぐに目に入った…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:709
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_01b21009:

    # MC @ scared "(It... It was a dream!)"
    MC @ scared "(これは…夢だった!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:712
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d62002c2:

    # MC @ think "(...Right?)"
    MC @ think "(...そうだよね？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:724
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f1834407:

    # DUPREY "...So, having being around a little, what do you lot think matters the most in battle?"
    DUPREY "……少しは戦ってきてるお前らだが、戦場で一番大事なものは何だと思う？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:725
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_84edc41c:

    # "We looked at each other puzzled."
    "私たちは困惑した表情で顔を見合わせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:727
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_cef8185e:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Strength?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}強さ？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:728
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6cf01769:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Our gear!{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}私たちの装備!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:729
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_5b70b478:

    # "Some of us were throwing more words out there, until..."
    "何人かは言葉を交わしたりしていたが…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:730
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_59efef91:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Being like... a single force?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}一体のような存在？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:731
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_60c375e0:

    # "I swear I saw a hint of suprise on Duprey's face:"
    "間違いなく、デュプレイの顔に驚きの色が見えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:732
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_a52d9426:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Right on, lad!"
    DUPREY @ laugh "いいぞ、少年!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:733
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ae81de48:

    # "Silence covered our ranks, as we have began to realize what today's lesson was about."
    "黙りが我々の陣を覆った、今日の教訓が何であったかを理解し始めたのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:734
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_c6bbed4f:

    # "Duprey smiled for a moment as he continued:"
    "デュプレイは一瞬、微笑むとこう続けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:735
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f6068bdd:

    # DUPREY "Teamwork, lads."
    DUPREY "チームワークだ、みんな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:736
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2c171579:

    # DUPREY "Confidence in a soldier to your left and a soldier to your right, {i}this{/i} is the driving force behind any worthy army."
    DUPREY "左には兵士、右には兵士への信頼、{i}これこそが{/i}いかなる有能な軍隊の原動力である。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:737
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_479fffc2:

    # "Duprey began pointing at recruits from the crowd:"
    "デュプレイは群衆の中から新兵たちを指差し始めた:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:738
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_54599814:

    # DUPREY "You can have the best gear in all Alderay!"
    DUPREY "アルデレイで最高の装備を手に入れられるぞ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:739
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fae39187:

    # DUPREY "And you can be an expert at handling your weapon of choice,"
    DUPREY "そして、選んだ武器の扱いの達人になることもできる"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:740
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_812a5810:

    # DUPREY "While your bag of dirty tricks can grow as large as to become a caravan,"
    DUPREY "どんなに汚い手口を重ねようと、その数々は隊商一つ分にもなるほどだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:741
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_671d40a2:

    # "Some recruits laughed as Duprey continued, ever more serious:"
    "更に真剣な口調でデュプレが続ける中、笑う者たちもいた："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:742
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2ff1717a:

    # DUPREY "But if you don't have a warrior, a true battle brother you are dead sure in at your side,"
    DUPREY "だが、戦士、絶対的に信じられる真の戦いの相棒がいないなら、"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:743
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ff502967:

    # DUPREY "One who would stand with you no matter what is coming at you..."
    DUPREY "何が来ようとも、君と共に立つ者…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:744
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_95d64e38:

    # "Duprey's expression turned pale for a moment, as if his mind's eye erupted with memories."
    "デュプレイの表情が一瞬青ざめた。まるで脳裏に記憶が噴き出したかのように。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:745
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fa17f4b8:

    # DUPREY "You {i}will be{/i} obliterated."
    DUPREY "お前は{i}必ず{/i}消し飛ぶ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:746
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_828b281f:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other and nodded stoically, but Duprey's usual commanding tone snapped us out of it quick:"
    "マルクスと私は互いに目を見合わせ、沈黙のうちにうなずいたが、デュプレのいつもの命令口調が、素早く我に返らせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:747
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_b5b6ec4e:

    # DUPREY "None of us would want that to happen, right you maggots?!"
    DUPREY "そんな事は誰も望まないだろうな、この蛆虫共？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:749
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_41a3cf71:

    # DUPREY "Today, you will spar in teams of two!"
    DUPREY "本日は、2人組でスパーリングを行います!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:750
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_dfb15ac9:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, and get to it!"
    DUPREY "組んで、始めろ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:751
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "……スタート!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:775
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_22336bc1:

    # MARKUS "Phew... You guys kicked our ass!"
    MARKUS "ふう…すっかり完敗だな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:776
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d5403c39:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again now!"
    MARKUS "さあ、もう一度行こう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:777
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d4066694:

    # MARKUS "I swear you won't get us this time!"
    MARKUS "絶対に今度はやらせない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:779
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4303ca27:

    # "Markus and his teammate both looked at us two."
    "マルクスとその相棒は、二人の私達を見ている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:780
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4c68b6fe:

    # MARKUS "Come on guys, remember what Duprey said!"
    MARKUS "おい君ら、デュプレの言ったことを覚えているか!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:781
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_072ed379:

    # MARKUS "Be a single force!"
    MARKUS "単一の力となれ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:782
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_7e6c58ca:

    # "His teammate interrupted:"
    "彼のチームメイトが口を挟んだ："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:784
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_c87c6273:

    # RECRUIT "Actually... it was me who said it..."
    RECRUIT "実は…私が言ったんです…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:785
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_76d4b651:

    # "I let out a laugh which echoed painfully all over my body."
    "笑い声をあげて、痛みと共に体のあちこちに響いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:786
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_33a51547:

    # MARKUS "... Whatever! Come on, let's go for another round!"
    MARKUS "…もういいや!さあ、もう一戦しよう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:789
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_2af51c90:

    # MARKUS "That's what I like to hear!"
    MARKUS "それはいいね!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:790
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_102beb74:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Let's see if our 'army' defeats yours this time!"
    MARKUS @ smile "では、今度は私たちの「軍隊」が君たちを倒すかどうか見てみましょう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:794
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "それじゃあ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:795
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1506ca74:

    # MARKUS "I've sprained my ankle anyways..."
    MARKUS "まあ、足首捻挫しちゃったし…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:798
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_3c091867:

    # "The rest of the day we have spent learning more nuances about working together as a combat unit."
    "その日は一日中、戦闘部隊として連携することの詳細について学んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:799
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1da7d2b2:

    # "As we have come to realize the importance of teamwork in practice, Duprey's initial statement of it being the crucial aspect of warfare became clear as day."
    "実践を通じてチームワークの重要性を改めて理解した今、デュプレが戦争の要諦と最初に説いていた言葉が、明白になった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:800
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_73c0dac8:

    # "We had to {i}become{/i} the Second Scouts Division."
    "我々は第二偵察隊に{i}なったのだ{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:805
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5d262372:

    # DUPREY "...So, that will be it for today, Scouts."
    DUPREY "…では、今日はこれでおしまい、スカウトたち。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:806
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_b8c44b07:

    # DUPREY "And one more thing..."
    DUPREY "そしてもう一つ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:807
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_f2c412ef:

    # DUPREY "We can't be training in this cage forever,"
    DUPREY "この檻でいつまでも訓練はできないぞ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:808
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_fc3f4089:

    # "Duprey waved at the walls,"
    "デュプレイは壁に手を振った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:809
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5bc59c1b:

    # DUPREY "But before we begin any real training maneuvers, I need to see just how much you lot had learned since you've got here."
    DUPREY "しかし、本格的な訓練を始める前に、お前たちがここに来てからどれだけ学んだか、まず見せてもらおう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:810
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_37c4720a:

    # DUPREY "Hit that bunk hard for there will be a test tomorrow!"
    DUPREY "猛烈に勉強しろ、明日テストがあるぞ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:811
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "解散!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:816
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_70c270b5:

    # "Me and Markus exchanged looks."
    "俺とマーカスは顔を見合わせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:817
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5dbd6a38:

    # MARKUS "A test, huh?"
    MARKUS "テストか…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:818
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_0da95cfe:

    # MC "Whatever it is, let's go get some sleep."
    MC "とにかく、寝に行こう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:835
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6d3b7e65:

    # "In the dead of night, I was restless."
    "夜更け、私は眠れなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:840
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8c266e01:

    # "Opening my eyes, I sat-upright in my bunk and looked around."
    "目を開けると、ベッドに起き上がって辺りを見回した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:842
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccd5a8ea:

    # "Everyone around me was deep in sleep still, including Markus."
    "私の周りの皆は、まだ深く眠っていた。マーカスを含めて。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:843
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_03bec688:

    # "I sighed, rubbing my forehead as I climbed out of bed."
    "ため息をつきながら、額をこすって、ベッドから起き上がった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:844
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b9564fe7:

    # "{i}Just a short walk around the fort grounds{/i} I told myself..."
    "{i}城塞の敷地を少し歩くだけ…{/i}そう自分に言い聞かせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:845
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af74cbd2:

    # "I'll be back before anyone even realizes I'm gone."
    "誰にも気づかれないうちに戻ってくる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:852
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59eaf8b8:

    # "As the cold night air hit my lungs, I thought about heading back inside before I heard Captain Duprey's voice."
    "冷たい夜の空気が肺に染みる中、ちょうど中に戻ろうとした時、デュプレー大佐の声が聞こえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:853
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4acebe14:

    # DUPREY "Thank you all for coming..."
    DUPREY "皆さん、来てくれてありがとう…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:854
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_14ad4098:

    # MC "(Hm? What's going on?)"
    MC "(ふむ？どうしたんだろう？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:855
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b6dd5166:

    # MC "(It sounds like it's coming from the training yard.)"
    MC "(訓練場からのようだ。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:866
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f159a15b:

    # "Peering around the corner, Captain Duprey stood alongside Borras as two figures joined them."
    "角を覗きながら、デュプレイ艦長はボラスと並んで立っていた。そこに二人の人物が合流してきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:869
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_683fa502:

    # "The first, a beautiful, yet stern and cold looking blonde in a hooded robe."
    "最初は、フード付きのローブをまとった、美しいが厳格で冷たげな金髪の女性。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:870
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_39c09853:

    # "The other, a man of larger stature who I had not seen either."
    "もう一人は、体の大きい男で、やはり見覚えのない人物だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:872
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c3816f8a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Well, out with it."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "さあ、言いなよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:873
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_829708c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Why did you ask us to meet here and not in my office?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "ここで会ってほしいって言ったのはどうして？私のオフィスじゃなくて。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:874
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e5dab11:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "I'm freezing my tits off out here you know."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "堪らんぞ、この寒さは。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:875
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5d90ff9:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "I could keep them warm for you if you wish."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "ご希望なら、温めておきましょうか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:877
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8cce2042:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Lay a hand on me and you will never {i}touch{/i} anything again."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "私に手を出したら、二度と何にも{i}触れ{/i}られなくなるわ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:878
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccb33939:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Feisty as always."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "相変わらず元気がいい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:879
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7d3baf97:

    # DUPREY "I'm sorry for summoning you both at such a late hour."
    DUPREY "こんなに夜遅く二人を呼び出してしまい、すみません。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:880
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_438696b5:

    # DUPREY "I couldn't risk the potential of spies listening in on what I had to say now."
    DUPREY "今の私の言葉をスパイに聞かれる可能性に、危険を冒すわけにはいかなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:881
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_15a278d5:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "And out here is safer than my office how?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "で、こっちの方が私のオフィスより安全だってどういうこと？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:882
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ea753ae:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} I recently conducted a private search across the whole fortress with only my most trusted men."
    DUPREY "{i}*ため息*{/i}　この前、最も信頼できる部下だけで、この要塞全体を内密に捜索した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:883
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_627d96fc:

    # DUPREY "I found echo crystals everywhere... including your office."
    DUPREY "エコークリスタルは至る所で見つけました…あなたのオフィスでも。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:884
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e306341:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You..."
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "あなた…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:885
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2b146927:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Echo crystals?{/i}"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}エコー・クリスタルズ？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:886
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7cc2c81:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "That can't be right, I have my office checked, I-"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "そんなはずはない、私は自分のオフィスを確認している、私は―"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:887
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7233b5ac:

    # "Duprey nodded, holding up a small, glowing yellow crystal that he tossed to the robed blonde."
    "デュプレイはうなずき、小さな輝く黄色の結晶を取り出すと、それをローブ姿の金髪に投げ渡した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:889
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b21cd245:

    # DUPREY "I'm afraid it's so."
    DUPREY "残念ながら、その通りです。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:890
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3e335085:

    # "The woman inspected the crystal and gritted her teeth in anger at it."
    "女はその結晶を調べ、歯を食いしばって怒りを露わにした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:891
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1faccc03:

    # DUPREY "It seems our great {i}'emperor'{/i} does not hold our loyalty in high regard."
    DUPREY "どうやら偉大なる{i}『皇帝』{/i}は、我等の忠誠を重く見ておられぬようだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:892
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d6956b86:

    # "The larger man chuckled."
    "大柄な男が含み笑いを漏らした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:893
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cac71787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "After everything that's happened, can you truly blame him?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "今までのことを考えれば、彼を責められるだろうか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:894
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e7113e66:

    # "The blonde woman seemed more frustrated than the others, coiling her one hand into a tight fist."
    "金髪の女性は他の者たちより一層苛立っているように見えて、片手を硬く拳に握りしめている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:895
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_897edc9c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Come now, this is all part of the game."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "さあ、これもすべてゲームの一部に過ぎない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:896
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_da595d25:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Yes, I... I am aware."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "はい、私…分かっています。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:897
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_aed55156:

    # DUPREY "The guards only patrol this area periodically, and it's the one place no echo crystals turned up during the search."
    DUPREY "衛兵はこのエリアを定期的に巡回するだけだ。そして捜索中、エコークリスタルが見つからなかった唯一の場所でもある。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:898
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cf9fe043:

    # DUPREY "I suppose they figured the chatter of grunts wasn't worth hearing."
    DUPREY "雑兵の雑談など聞く価値もないと思ったのだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:899
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4b3ecc3c:

    # DUPREY "Which is exactly why we're meeting here now."
    DUPREY "それだからこそ、私たちはここで今こうして会っているのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:900
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97cd58fc:

    # "The larger man raised his brow."
    "大柄な男が眉を吊り上げる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:901
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c4efb787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "That's all well and good... But why exactly is {i}he{/i} here?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "確かに...それもわかるけど。でも、どうして{i}彼{/i}がここにいるの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:902
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ecda2cd:

    # "The man pointed towards Borras, whose brow furrowed at the comment."
    "男はボラスを指さしたが、その言葉に彼は眉をひそめて反応した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:903
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a377fbed:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "He's hardly fit to stand here with the rest of us."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "彼は我々と共にここに立つにはまったくふさわしくない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:904
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_000b3a6c:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras will be replacing me for command of the Second Scouts Division, within a year or so."
    DUPREY "ボラス士官は、１年ほどで第２偵察師団の指揮を私から引き継ぐことになります。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:905
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ade1214e:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You're leaving?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "行っちゃうの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:906
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2897e861:

    # DUPREY "My time is nearly up... I'm slowing down too much."
    DUPREY "私の時間はほぼ尽きた…遅くなりすぎている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:907
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1d99c218:

    # "While the blonde seemed saddened to hear this, the larger man opened his palm upwards towards the sky."
    "金髪の少女はそれを聞いて悲しそうだったが、大柄な男は空へ向かって掌を開いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:908
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c246e162:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I hope you didn't drag us out here to discuss your future retirement plans you old fuck."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "まさか、俺たちを引っ張り出して、老いぼれの今後の隠居話でもするつもりじゃないだろうな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:909
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dd633049:

    # DUPREY "Hmph..."
    DUPREY "ふん…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:910
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_07d9c1a1:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras, hand them the reports."
    DUPREY "ボラス巡査、彼らに報告書を渡してくれ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:911
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_85fc15c1:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Yes Captain."
    BORRAS @ talk "はい、キャプテン。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:913
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a550ea4e:

    # "Borras handed over a few sheets of paper towards the robed pair."
    "ボラスは、ローブを着た二人に数枚の紙を手渡した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:914
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e077ed9f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "What's this?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "これは何？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:915
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbb0024b:

    # DUPREY "A report that Alcott attempted to suppress."
    DUPREY "アルコットが隠蔽しようとした報告書。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:916
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0873ff5f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "About?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "について？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:917
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dfb5dc62:

    # DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak has returned.{/i}"
    DUPREY "…{i}ザナラクが帰還した。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:918
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dbf78d30:

    # "A great unease filled the air and I felt a shiver tingle it's way up my spine."
    "重苦しい不安が漂い、背筋にぞくりと戦慄が流れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:919
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_506be64d:

    # "The name crawled and dragged its way horribly across my thoughts."
    "その名前が恐ろしくも私の思考の中を這いずり回った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:920
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_04766be0:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "There hasn't been a sighting in years."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "長年、目撃はない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:921
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ad6d35ce:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wasn't it reported that the beast was hunted down by the Inquisition?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "その獣は異端審問会によって討伐されたと報告されてたじゃなかったか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:922
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbbee22b:

    # DUPREY "A lie told to ease panicking nobles."
    DUPREY "動揺する貴族たちを鎮めるための、語られた嘘。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:923
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_38a43a2d:

    # DUPREY "While it is true the beast has vanished for the last few years, this cannot be ignored."
    DUPREY "確かに、ここ数年その獣の姿は見られないが、無視はできない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:924
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_78892759:

    # DUPREY "The beast's return... changes things."
    DUPREY "獣の帰還…状況を一変させる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:925
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7a86413b:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "A specter, a boogeyman..."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "幻影、怪物…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:926
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a777b442:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "There are dozens of Demorai over the years that people have wrongly mistaken for being Zanarak."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "長年にわたり、何十体ものデモライが人々に誤ってザナラクの一体だと思い込まれていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:927
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_086782c0:

    # "The man belligerently crossed his arms."
    "男は挑発的に腕を組んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:928
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ee8e9a7d:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...I'm not even convinced this Zanarak was real to begin with."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "…そもそもザナラクが実在していたかどうかすら疑わしい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:929
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ebb0762:

    # DUPREY "Oh... He's as real as you and I alright."
    DUPREY "ああ…彼はあなたや私と同じように確かに現実の人ですよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:930
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ba99ad23:

    # DUPREY "Make no mistake about that."
    DUPREY "間違いなく、そういうことだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:931
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6b72d9c8:

    # DUPREY "...And when he comes, all of us need to be prepared."
    DUPREY "…そして彼が来たとき、私たち全員が準備を整えている必要がある。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:932
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2bce0fc0:

    # DUPREY "With, {i}or without{/i} the Emperors knowledge."
    DUPREY "皇帝の知るところと、{i}知らぬところとを問わず{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:933
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3cdbebf1:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "What are you saying, Duprey?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "何を言ってるんだ、デュプレイ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:934
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59e5864b:

    # DUPREY "I'm saying, Alcott can bury his head in the fucking sand and play politics all he wants to try and appease wet-fart nobles."
    DUPREY "いいか、アルコットがクソみたいな砂に頭を突っ込んで、生温い貴族どもを宥めようと政治ごっこに興じたって構わん。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:935
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_fcc3f2c9:

    # DUPREY "{i}But we need to be prepared for what's to come whether this knowledge is made public or not.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}この知識が公になるか否か、我々はこれから起こりうることへの備えが必要だ。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:936
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_18e7a24a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... You need to tread carefully with this."
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "デュプレイ…この件は慎重に進めてくれ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:937
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_5b839082:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "How exactly did {i}you{/i} manage to get your hands on this report anyway?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "一体どうやって{i}あんたが{/i}この報告書を手に入れたの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:938
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a2aca459:

    # BORRAS @ talk "By pure chance."
    BORRAS @ talk "純粋な偶然で。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:939
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a174e1ce:

    # "Borras stepped forward."
    "ボラスはステップを踏み出した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:940
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_913c0dc3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "I was on a normal patrol through the Valley of Death when I stumbled upon a small, slaughtered convoy."
    BORRAS @ talk "死の谷を普通に巡回していた時、僕は惨殺された小さな輸送部隊を偶然見つけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:941
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_787647a3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Amongst their dead was an Inquisitor, who with his dying breath handed me this report."
    BORRAS @ talk "死んだ者たちの中に、一人の審問官がおり、彼は死に際にこの報告書を手渡した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:942
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a7d9dd7a:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "The dying words of a delusional Inquisitor on death's door mean very little."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "妄想に駆られた審問官の、死の床での断末魔の言葉など、ほとんど無意味だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:943
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_46254da9:

    # BORRAS @ talk "There was other reports..."
    BORRAS @ talk "他の報告書もあった…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:944
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f3335e6e:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "What?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "え？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:945
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_825a1215:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Suppressed as soon as they arrive, but more and more scant reports from our men on the fringes have reported seeing it."
    BORRAS @ talk "到着するやいなや制圧されたが、周辺にいる我々の部隊から、ごく少数ながらそれを目撃したという報告が増えている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:946
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0d7eadc0:

    # "Both the woman and man were troubled the more they heard."
    "女も男も、聞けば聞くほどに心を痛めていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:947
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f2428e23:

    # DUPREY "From now on, the three of us need to work closer together."
    DUPREY "これから私たち三人は、一層協力していく必要があります。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:948
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a899d6c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "The city guard is barely holding on as it is, what exactly do you expect me to do?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "都市の衛兵は今やっと持ちこたえている状態だ。
一体どうしろというんだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:949
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b10a0545:

    # DUPREY "Whatever you have to do when the time comes."
    DUPREY "いざという時は何でもしろ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:950
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6afc1660:

    # "Duprey seemed to be working himself up into a feverish plea."
    "デュプレは熱っぽい訴えに自分を奮い立たせているようだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:951
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_104f25e1:

    # DUPREY "These little camps everyone's set up is leaving us more divided than ever, it'll be the ruin of us all!"
    DUPREY "みんなが作ったちっぽけな陣営が、以前よりも私たちを分断している。このままでは、みんな共倒れだよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:952
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2e21a987:

    # DUPREY "We need to unite and pledge to each other that when the time comes-"
    DUPREY "我々は団結し、時が来たら―と互いに誓い合わなければならない"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:953
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59c8c819:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I promise you nothing, Duprey."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "私はあなたに何も約束しない、デュプレイ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:954
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e629b28d:

    # "The broad man's words cut through Duprey's like ice."
    "幅広い男の言葉が、デュプレイのを氷のように切り裂いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:955
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b4c2c3b7:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...But I shall look into these reports myself."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "しかし、この報告は私自身が確認しよう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:956
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ebf4078c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "And depending on what I find, {i}perhaps{/i} there will be more to discuss."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "そして、見つかるもの次第で、{i}もしかすると{/i}話すことが増えるかもしれない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:957
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e102cb4c:

    # "The broad man turned to leave, and as he did so, Captain Duprey looked towards the woman."
    "そして太っちょの男は去ろうと背を向ける、その時、デュプレイ大尉は女の方に視線を向けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:958
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6ff2487b:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... I don't know, Duprey, this just maybe isn't the right time."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "…さあね、デュプレイ。今はちょっと…タイミングが悪いかも。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:959
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ece5bef6:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "The more we unite our forces, the more we paint ourselves a target for the other factions."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "力を合わせれば合わせるほど、我々は他陣営の標的になるのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:960
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5cdc275:

    # DUPREY "... I don't care about the factions."
    DUPREY "…派閥なんてどうでもいい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:961
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_361df80b:

    # DUPREY "I don't care about the politics of the damn thing."
    DUPREY "くだらない内情なんて、気にしない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:962
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_538b8cf8:

    # DUPREY "What does any of that matter if there's no one left in the end?"
    DUPREY "結局、誰もいなくなってしまったなら、何の意味がある？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:963
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7e9daac:

    # DUPREY "Newheart is gone... There's no one left to save us but ourselves now."
    DUPREY "ニューハートはもういない…。今や私たち自身以外に、誰も私たちを救ってはくれない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:964
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e94a49a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Goodnight, Duprey."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "…おやすみなさい、デュプレイ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:965
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2d5676a4:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "I hope you're wrong about all this... I really do."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "すべてが間違っていてほしい…心からそう願うわ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:966
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3bff260d:

    # "The woman turned to leave and join the broad man, leaving Captain Duprey to stand beside Officer Borras alone."
    "女性は屈強な男に合流しようと、背を向けた。
残されたデュプレー船長は、ボラス警官と並んで立つのみであった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:970
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_9b060e61:

    # "As the two figures passed me by, I hid myself behind a barrel and waited for them to be out of sight."
    "二人の影が通り過ぎるのを、私は樽の陰に身を潜めて、その影が視界から消えるのを待った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:973
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d553e83d:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Captain..."
    BORRAS @ talk "艦長…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:974
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_eba06326:

    # DUPREY "Return to your quarters, Borras."
    DUPREY "自分の部屋に戻れ、ボラス。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:975
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6fa2cda7:

    # DUPREY "Speak nothing of what has been said tonight."
    DUPREY "今夜の話は決して口外してはならない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:976
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f9c712a9:

    # BORRAS @ sad "But-"
    BORRAS @ sad "でも－"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:977
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_87e8ae86:

    # DUPREY "I'm tired Borras... So very tired."
    DUPREY "疲れたよ、ボラス…本当に疲れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:978
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ae2d5a5:

    # DUPREY "The next battle can wait for another day."
    DUPREY "次の戦いは、他日を期そう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:981
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a5187100:

    # "Slowly, I watched as Captain Duprey slumped towards the barracks, likely back to his quarters."
    "ゆっくりと、デュプレー艦長が兵舎、おそらく私室へと傾くように去って行く様子を見送った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:983
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e034c8e5:

    # MC "(Zanarak... Can it really be?)"
    MC "(ザナラク…まさか…？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:985
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97d93231:

    # "I shook my head, pushing the terrible thoughts away."
    "首を振り、嫌な考えを振り払った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:986
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d2897e6b:

    # MC "(I need to return to my bed, before someone sees me.)"
    MC "(誰かに見つかる前に、ベッドに戻らなければ。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:992
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97284131:

    # "As I laid down onto the bed, dark, terrible thoughts and dreams returned."
    "ベッドに横たわると、暗く恐ろしい思考と夢が戻ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:993
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af180033:

    # "Returned to torment me for the rest of the night."
    "私を苦しめるために戻ってきて、夜の残りの時間を台無しにしてしまった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1008
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_eb24fb27:

    # DUPREY "Alright maggots, today I will see whether you lot have made any progress or had you just wasted my time!"
    DUPREY "よし、雑魚共、今日はお前らが進歩したか、それとも俺の時間を無駄にしたか見せてもらおう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1009
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_884243ea:

    # DUPREY "We will start with duels first!"
    DUPREY "まずは決闘から始めましょう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1010
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_62189e19:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, grab yourself a healing vial, and fight as if your life depended on it!"
    DUPREY "パートナーと組んで、回復薬の小瓶を手にし、命がけで戦え!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1015
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_761342c6:

    # MC "Shit got real, huh?"
    MC "マジやばいな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1016
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_67044540:

    # "Markus was certainly not going to fool around this time."
    "今回ばかりは、マーカスはふざけるつもりはなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1018
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_bc95234e:

    # MC @ angry "Alright, bring it on then!"
    MC @ angry "よし、かかってこい!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1052
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_1263e952:

    # "Ouch."
    "痛い。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1053
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_c58b41a1:

    # "Darkness."
    "闇。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1054
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8f6cd72d:

    # "Then, dim light telling shapes apart."
    "ほのかな光が輪郭を浮かび上がらせる"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1055
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_ce93bfa4:

    # "A vision."
    "幻影。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1056
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_a05d37f2:

    # "A vision of Alderay under demonic onslaught."
    "魔軍の襲撃を受けるアルデレイの光景。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1057
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_f32b1941:

    # "Of me, defending it's people."
    "私がその民を守る姿。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1058
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_27cd56c1:

    # "Uniting them under my banners."
    "我が旗幟の下に彼らを集める。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1059
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_63b84b20:

    # "Power."
    "力。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1060
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_008f17f9:

    # "Wealth."
    "富。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1061
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d7eea514:

    # "Women..."
    "女性たち…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1062
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_b6ce6190:

    # "However, there is something else."
    "しかし、他に何かがある。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1063
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8bf4ebd2:

    # "Something that drives me onwards, something from outside..."
    "何かが私を駆り立てる、外側からの何かが…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1064
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_90b93b6a:

    # "It's..."
    "それ は…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1067
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d1df3db6:

    # "Ice-cold water!"
    "氷のように冷たい水!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1073
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_bc5c4518:

    # DUPREY "{b}ON YOUR FEET, MAGGOT!{/b}"
    DUPREY "{b}立て、蛆虫め!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1074
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_5ad11caa:

    # "Captain Duprey's heavy kick quickly stood me up straight, recent knockout echoing in my head with an irritating, pulsing pain."
    "デュプレー艦長の強烈な一蹴りで、私はするやいなや直立たされた。直前に気絶したことが、頭の中にこだまするように、いらだたしいずきずきした痛みとなって蘇った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1075
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_e7a57264:

    # DUPREY "Go again, Demorai won't wait for you to come back to your senses!"
    DUPREY "もう一度行け、デモライはお前が意識を取り戻すまで待ってはくれん!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1076
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_032e9f26:

    # MC "(Gotta get a grip...)"
    MC "(落ち着け…)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1077
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_523ecf6e:

    # DUPREY @ angry "I'm trying to be nice to you maggot, now go again!"
    DUPREY @ angry "こいつ、親切にしてやろうとしてるんだぞ、この蛆虫め!さあ、今すぐやり直せ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1089
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6a4925e0:

    # MARKUS "Gah! You sure know how to make it hurt!"
    MARKUS "ぐあっ!痛いことだけは得意だな!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1090
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fb6a986:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Someone’s had to knock some sense into you!"
    MC "{i}*はあ*{/i} 誰かがあなたに目を覚ませさせる必要があったのよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1091
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_66516ca5:

    # "As me and Markus caught our breath, I noticed an unusual figure dressed in fine fabrics speaking to the Captain."
    "私とマーカスが息を整えながら、上質な服をまとった妙な風体の人物が船長に話しかけているのに気づいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1092
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_163ee6d6:

    # "The Captain seemed unimpressed with whatever the man was saying and seemed to be refusing him something before being handed what seemed like a very official looking letter."
    "船長はその男の言うことにはあまり感心していないようで、何かを拒んでいる様子だったが、やがて非常に格式ばった書状のようなものを手渡された。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1093
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_783e0863:

    # "I thought I could make out the royal seal."
    "確かに王室の紋章が見えた気がする。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1094
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_edb3c6df:

    # "I couldn’t hear what was being said, but I managed to figure out the words escaping his lips, {i}‘They’re not ready yet!’{/i}"
    "何を言っているのか聞こえはしなかったが、彼の唇から零れる言葉を読み取ることができた。
{i}「奴らはまだ準備ができていない!」{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1095
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7e66af39:

    # MARKUS "What’s going on?"
    MARKUS "どうしたの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1096
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_28993885:

    # "I nudged him to look over towards Duprey."
    "彼を軽くつつき、デュプレーの方へ視線を向けさせるように合図した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1097
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_78c93499:

    # MARKUS "... Is that someone from the palace?"
    MARKUS "…あれは宮殿の方ですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1098
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6da37e5e:

    # MC "I think so."
    MC "そう思う。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1099
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c390d19a:

    # MARKUS "Since when did the palace send its fancy officials down to us mud and grunts?"
    MARKUS "宮廷の偉そうな役人たちが、いつから泥まみれの雑兵に用事があるってんだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1100
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d52535a2:

    # MARKUS "What do you think they want? It must be serious."
    MARKUS "彼らは何が目的だと思う？深刻なことだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1101
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_67965d23:

    # MC "I don’t know... but I don’t think it’s going to be anything good."
    MC "よくわからない…でも、何かいいことじゃなさそう"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1106
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_452c6b58:

    # "All of a sudden, the Captain heaved himself reluctantly onto the wooden platform and cried out for our attention."
    "突然、艦長はしぶしぶ木の台に乗り上がると、我々の注意を引こうと叫んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1107
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4074b31d:

    # DUPREY "FORM RANKS!"
    DUPREY "整列!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1109
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7bdc104e:

    # "The tired and weary Scouts hastily moved to form neat rows and face the Captain, hanging on his every word."
    "疲れ切ったスカウトたちは、慌ただしく整列し、隊長の一言一言に耳を傾けながら、彼に向き直った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1110
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d0187a8e:

    # DUPREY "We have been ordered on early leave for a mission."
    DUPREY "作戦のため、早期帰還を命じられた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1111
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_af5fac36:

    # "Confused mutterings swept through the ranks, as most of us expected the training to last for months."
    "戸惑いの呟きが隊列に広がった。訓練は数か月続くものと、私たちの多くが予想していたからだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1112
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_41c2d6b4:

    # DUPREY "SILENCE!!!"
    DUPREY "黙れ!!!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1113
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_219c5f53:

    # DUPREY "This order has come down from Emperor Alcott himself and has been approved by King Mesamor."
    DUPREY "この勅命はアルコット皇帝自らが下し、メサモール王の認可を得ている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1114
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b792546:

    # DUPREY "We leave come first light tomorrow."
    DUPREY "明日の夜明けに出発する。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1115
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fa47cd9:

    # DUPREY "Get to bed early, make sure you’re well fed and be absolutely certain that your equipment is clean and ready."
    DUPREY "早く寝て、十分に食事を取り、装備が清潔で準備万端であることを絶対に確認しろ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1116
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cae6e8d4:

    # "A timid hand was raised from the crowd."
    "おそるおそる、群衆の中から一本の手が挙がった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1117
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c2e2d792:

    # DUPREY "What is it?"
    DUPREY "なに？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1119
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_13b24539:

    # RECRUIT "Where are we to be sent, sir?"
    RECRUIT "我々はどこへ送られるのでしょうか、閣下？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1120
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_544b0d7d:

    # DUPREY "The mission is top secret, all I can tell you is that you will be recovering relics from a lost fortress south of here."
    DUPREY "任務は極秘だ。伝えられるのは、この南にある失われた要塞から遺物を回収するということだけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1121
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac7589b:

    # DUPREY "Expect at least six weeks march, take this into consideration with your prep."
    DUPREY "行軍は少なくとも六週間は見込め、準備にはこの点を考慮に入れよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1122
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "解散!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1125
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cfa9b03:

    # "With that, the Captain stormed his way off stage, angrily shoving the sealed letter back into the fumbling hands of the palace official before stalking back to his quarters."
    "そう言うと、船長は怒りながらステージを降り、封印された手紙を宮廷官僚のおぼつかない手に押し戻すと、自室へと戻っていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1126
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fa69c2ee:

    # "The men soon dissolved the ranks and the process of packing up for our departure began."
    "男たちはすぐに隊列を解き、我々の出立の準備を始めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1132
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_73d9be9c:

    # "There was much confused chatter about what this {i}‘secret mission’{/i} entailed, and more so the worry of now being confronted by the Demorai so clearly unprepared."
    "この「極秘任務」の内容については困惑した噂が多く、何より、明らかに準備不足でデモライに直面することへの心配が広がっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1133
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d33077f7:

    # MARKUS "What the fuck was all that about?"
    MARKUS "一体全体、あれはどういうことだよ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1134
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_07f11245:

    # MC "I don’t know, looks like some higher up bullshit to me."
    MC "さあ、わからないよ。偉い人たちの戯言みたいだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1135
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3e0ef9c5:

    # MC "Guess we'll be skipping the test then..."
    MC "じゃあテストをサボるってことか…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1136
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_52b2a82f:

    # MARKUS "Hm... I’ll make sure to pack some extra bread for you, okay?"
    MARKUS "ふむ…  
パンを多めに入れておくね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1137
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f6d7e7b6:

    # MC "Where’d you get the extra rations from, you fancy fuck?"
    MC "お前、その余分の食料はどこで手に入れたんだ、キザな野郎。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1138
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a1c732d3:

    # MARKUS "My brother sent it to me the other day, figured we could split it..."
    MARKUS "この前、兄が送ってきたんだ…一緒に分けようと思って…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1139
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ce4a9c8a:

    # MC "Oh, thank you."
    MC "あら、ありがとう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1140
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7ff3445a:

    # MARKUS "In return I want some of that sweet wine you got!"
    MARKUS "その代わりに、君が持ってるあの甘いワインを頂戴よ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1141
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_95e59f81:

    # MC "What?!"
    MC "なに?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1143
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b5596df:

    # MC "Alright, alright, {i}we’ll share.{/i}"
    MC "わかった、わかった、{i}分けてあげる。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1144
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_31c038e0:

    # MARKUS "That’s more like it!"
    MARKUS "よし、これでこそ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1145
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbd1034e:

